  "notes": "Waiver filing (Exhibit A, period 10/1/21-9/30/22; prescribed form not audited, reviewed or compiled). Total column used for statement lines (General, Street, Keno funds). Beginning/ending cash are line 3 / line 24 balances including investments (beginning 43,541.22, ending CDs 44,047.23), not filled separately, as in FY2023-FY2024. County treasurer balances (1,431.54 / 1,457.37) printed below the form, not included. Municipal equalization aid printed in the Street Fund column, recorded as printed. Capital Improvements in the General Fund column has no printed function (plain Capital Outlay); Street Fund column -> Streets/Highways. Transfers from Exhibit A lines 20/50 (Total column 15,705.31); the interfund transfer schedule on p3 shows only 5,081.68 (recorded as a report discrepancy). Loan outstanding 147,815.27 (p3) not on the cash statement. No supplementary schedules; detail is per fund column of Exhibit A. Read pages 1-3 of 3"
